        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hold to rise and release to dive. Avoid countless obstacles and fight almighty bosses to reclaim your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to our original soundtrack while collecting seeds to buy all the clothes and fight with style!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 21st century, the country became the stage for one of the greatest calamities of our time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Louis, a worm fighting for a balanced meal in a hostile world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/9f7a96326e19039e0e518e535c001f29.poster.avif?t=1787876068\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/9f7a96326e19039e0e518e535c001f29.webm?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/9f7a96326e19039e0e518e535c001f29.mp4?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world is sweet — but it can be sour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oranges, kiwis, apples… every blessing in this tropical paradise becomes a deadly threat to those who dare rise for lunch. Escape the dangers and reach the finish line to battle the fruit's boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/c6e87eff90fe8cd67427f4e8b84dc327.poster.avif?t=1787876068\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/c6e87eff90fe8cd67427f4e8b84dc327.webm?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/c6e87eff90fe8cd67427f4e8b84dc327.mp4?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight for what’s yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You thought that chainsaws and pie-throwing machines were the worst you'd find inside an apple? These fruits have owners — and they don’t like to share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/99240a1b82ae3a9dea053354b7f71938.poster.avif?t=1787876068\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/99240a1b82ae3a9dea053354b7f71938.webm?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/99240a1b82ae3a9dea053354b7f71938.mp4?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the fairest of them all</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your seeds are like gold, and in this world, gold buys style. Unlock all the outfits for Louis and dress for glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/4b702f07aa3888f899d6fdda9c341226.poster.avif?t=1787876068\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/4b702f07aa3888f899d6fdda9c341226.webm?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/4b702f07aa3888f899d6fdda9c341226.mp4?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hold to rise and release to dive. Avoid countless obstacles and fight almighty bosses to reclaim your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to our original soundtrack while collecting seeds to buy all the clothes and fight with style!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 21st century, the country became the stage for one of the greatest calamities of our time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Louis, a worm fighting for a balanced meal in a hostile world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/9f7a96326e19039e0e518e535c001f29.poster.avif?t=1787876068\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/9f7a96326e19039e0e518e535c001f29.webm?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/9f7a96326e19039e0e518e535c001f29.mp4?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world is sweet — but it can be sour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oranges, kiwis, apples… every blessing in this tropical paradise becomes a deadly threat to those who dare rise for lunch. Escape the dangers and reach the finish line to battle the fruit's boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/c6e87eff90fe8cd67427f4e8b84dc327.poster.avif?t=1787876068\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/c6e87eff90fe8cd67427f4e8b84dc327.webm?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/c6e87eff90fe8cd67427f4e8b84dc327.mp4?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight for what’s yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You thought that chainsaws and pie-throwing machines were the worst you'd find inside an apple? These fruits have owners — and they don’t like to share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/99240a1b82ae3a9dea053354b7f71938.poster.avif?t=1787876068\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/99240a1b82ae3a9dea053354b7f71938.webm?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/99240a1b82ae3a9dea053354b7f71938.mp4?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the fairest of them all</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your seeds are like gold, and in this world, gold buys style. Unlock all the outfits for Louis and dress for glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/4b702f07aa3888f899d6fdda9c341226.poster.avif?t=1787876068\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/4b702f07aa3888f899d6fdda9c341226.webm?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281650/extras/4b702f07aa3888f899d6fdda9c341226.mp4?t=1787876068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
